# EXPECT-VIOLATION: mirash:AssetClassInstanceShape
#
# Model vs installed instance. One node is declared BOTH a reusable model (AssetClass) and a
# physical thing bolted to the plant (AssetInstance). A model has no location, no live signals and
# no work orders, so a diagnosis aimed at this node could be answered from either meaning.

@prefix mira: <https://ontology.factorylm.com/mira#> .
@prefix xsd:  <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .
@prefix ex:   <https://example.org/fx#> .

ex:gs10_2p0 a mira:AssetClass , mira:AssetInstance .
